      "text": "Chaaa!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_11",
      "hash64": "F78405D5B9B78B0E",
      "text": "It’s expressing happiness! Doesn’t it make you\\njust want to break out into a happy dance?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_12",
      "hash64": "F78404D5B9B7895B",
      "text": "But I didn’t have to ask Pikachu to put on an act\\ntoday. Oh no—I simply asked it to show you all\\r\\nhow it felt about getting to have class with you![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_13",
      "hash64": "F78403D5B9B787A8",
      "text": "Getting to meet so many new friends and study\\ntogether in this class with you...[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_14",
      "hash64": "F7840AD5B9B7938D",
      "text": "It’s made both me and my little Pikachu so\\nvery happy![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_15",
      "hash64": "F78409D5B9B791DA",
      "text": "And now, apropos of nothing, let me give you\\nall one last wise word of advice![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_16",
      "hash64": "F78408D5B9B79027",
      "text": "As you live your lives, I’m sure you will all have\\ntimes when you get mad or sad—maybe even\\r\\nmore than you would like![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_17",
      "hash64": "F78407D5B9B78E74",
      "text": "Everything has its ups and downs. Life is a\\nveritable roller coaster![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_18",
      "hash64": "F783FED5B9B77F29",
      "text": "But, à la fin—in the end, that is—there is surely\\nhappiness waiting for you!\\c\\nSo gardez le sourire—keep a smile on your face—\\neven in the hardest of times![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 157,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
